<title>USA: St Joseph hogs steady - USDA.</title>
<headline>St Joseph hogs steady - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>ST JOSEPH 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said compared with Thursday, barrows and gilts were steady. Top $53.50 per cwt.</p>
<p>Snow storm reduced late week marketings but at current cut-outs packers had already cut kills this week and not making any big Saturday plans.</p>
<p>    US 1-3    230-270 lbs    53.00-53.50</p>
<p>    US 2-3    270-290 lbs    51.50-52.50</p>
<p>Sows - steady/off $1.00. Top $54.00.</p>
<p>    US 1-2    300-450 lbs    44.00</p>
<p>		  450-500 lbs    46.00-47.00</p>
<p>    US 1-3    500-550 lbs    50.00</p>
<p>		  550-700 lbs    53.00-54.00</p>
</text>
